Deal
    max discount: 35%
    list price
    discount <=@max discount
    net =@list price*(1-@discount) if @list price else None
    - Enterprise Deal
        - Acme
            list price: $100,000
            discount: 30%
            net: $70,000
        - Beta
            list price: $10000
            discount: 20%
            net: $8,000
    - Standard Deal
        - Kite
            list price: €20,000
            discount: 15%
            net: €17,000
        - String
            list price: €29,000
            discount: 1%
            net: €28,710

